question_text:
Respond only with ETHICAL or UNETHICAL. You may add a brief explanation after.

AITA For Tricking My Girlfriend into Paying the Tab | Ive recently been bitching about finances to my gf. Basically saying that we go out to often and spend too much. To fix this she suggested we go out and she pay last weekend. So I drive us to a new restaurant, its nicer than places we normally go. We have dinner and a few drinks. When the bill comes we both look and its...very high. She asks "can we split this one" I tell her yes. She takes her card out and puts it in the pocket of the bill. I take my card out of my wallet as if Im going to place it with hers. Instead I close the bill and immediately hand it to our waiter.

&#x200B;

We laughed at how ungentlemanly that was of me. Shes a great sport..

&#x200B;

But..I stand by it! I would not have gone out had she not offered to take me out on her dime! I believe that SHE's the asshole for offering to pay..then seeing the price...then asking me to split!
